  <datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"3-ring binder containing 16 laser and ink jet prints, 8.5 x 11" (prints), 12 x 10.75 x 1.5" (binder). This is a limited-edition book created in conjunction with my re-enactment of On Kawara's I Went. It features prints of the maps I drew on the first day of every month - 13 maps in total (because I traveled between two locations on one of the days). Each map is printed with a red line showing the path I traced that day and hand-stamped with the date. Locations include New York City, Berlin, Montreal, Miami, and Amherst, MA." --Artist's website, viewed September 17, 2015.</subfield>
